+## ⑨-4/2/c: outcome assembly (2026-11-12)
+
+### The rulings
+
+Source: `docs/nautilus_bridge/OWNER_RULINGS_LOG.md`, section "2026-11-11, Claude Code 채팅: 결정 요청 P·A·B·C·D
